Both Task 14 follow-ups are fixed and verified:

### 1. Landing Hydration Mismatch (`next dev`)
- **Root cause:** Opening `/` in `next dev -p 3125` with Playwright showed the mismatch was on the 72 probe-station reticle `<line data-reticle-tick="">` SVG attributes (`x1`, `y1`, `x2`, `y2`) inside `LandingHero` (`src/ui/layout/EmptyStateCard.tsx`). Unrounded `Math.sin` / `Math.cos` results differed by 1 ULP between Node SSR and Chromium V8 (e.g. `y1="99.33733542039141"` vs `99.3373354203914`).
- **Fix:** Added `roundSvgCoord` and `computeLandingReticleTickLines` (rounding to 3 decimal places, normalizing `-0`) in [landing-layout.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/layout/landing-layout.ts#L70-L103) and used them in [EmptyStateCard.tsx](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/layout/EmptyStateCard.tsx#L580-L639).
- **Regression checks:**
  - Verified 0 `console.error`, 0 `pageerror`, and `data-error="false"` on the Next.js dev badge in `next dev -p 3125` across desktop light/dark, mobile light, reduced motion, and stored `cal.theme`/`cal.locale` states.
  - Added coordinate precision unit assertions in [landing-layout.test.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/layout/landing-layout.test.ts#L49-L71) and SSR markup assertions in [empty-state.test.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/layout/empty-state.test.ts#L110-L120).
  - Added `consoleErrors` / `pageErrors` assertions on `/` in [scaffold.spec.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/e2e/scaffold.spec.ts#L3-L35).

### 2. Flaky `brushing-t14` Pareto Baseline
- **Root cause:** `loadDemoLot` returned once `wafer-stage` reached `data-sweep="done"` (~280 ms ignite), while Pareto share-of-fails pills in `BinParetoChart` were still partway through their 600 ms `CountUp` animation, capturing mid-count values (e.g. `90.0%` instead of `91.3%`) in `paretoBefore`.
- **Fix:** Updated [count-up.tsx](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/primitives/count-up.tsx#L76-L108) to imperatively set `data-settled="false"` while its `requestAnimationFrame` count-up runs and `data-settled="true"` once the final text is written (or immediately under reduced motion / interrupt / `play={false}`), without changing SSR output or adding React re-renders. Updated `loadDemoLot` in [brushing-t14.spec.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/e2e/brushing-t14.spec.ts#L24-L33) to wait until all `[data-testid="bin-pareto-pill"] .count-up` elements have `data-settled="true"` before snapshotting baseline text.

